## 3. Technology Stack & Directory Structure

### 3.1 Technology Matrix
- **Runtime & Backend Framework:** Node.js 20 LTS + Express.js 4+
- **Database & ODM:** MongoDB 7.0+ + Mongoose 8.0+
- **Frontend Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router) + React 18
- **Styling & Charts:** Tailwind CSS 3+ + Recharts 2+
- **Authentication:** Stateless JWT (`HS256`, 7-day expiration) + `bcryptjs` (12 salt rounds)
- **Background Jobs & Automation:** `node-cron`
- **Push & Communications:** `web-push` (VAPID) + `nodemailer` (SMTP)

